{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17199","headline":"奉和刘侍郎司徒奉诏伐叛书情呈宰相 · 权德舆","name":"奉和刘侍郎司徒奉诏伐叛书情呈宰相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉帐元侯重，黄枢上宰雄。\n缘情词律外，宣力庙谋中。\n震耀恭天讨，严凝助岁功。\n行看画麟阁，凛凛有英风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}